      "verdict": "\uc77c\uce58",
      "fix": "Welcome to the Yi Seung-hun Peter Shrine at Banjugol in Jangsu-dong, Namdong-gu, Incheon. This is the true grave where Peter Yi Seung-hun, the first Korean to be baptized in Beijing in 1784 and martyred in 1801, lay buried. In this valley lies the story of a man who returned to the faith and gave his life for it, and of martyrdoms that followed in his family for four generations. Today we will begin at the memorial hall and follow the boardwalk Way of the Cross to the grave."
